{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id194672149"}, "name":{"label":"Dan-gerous"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-27T11:37:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"11541777957"}, "title":{"label":"Such a Shame"}, "content":{"label":"This latest update has crippled the app for me. I’m running it on an iPhone 14, so I THINK that should be enough hardware to handle it. Unfortunately, syncing takes forever, stalls and I have to reboot it every time I open the app. Then it just won’t download the latest episode of a podcast. Huge bummer", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id126562093"}, "name":{"label":"Tancook11"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-27T10:20:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"11541560377"}, "title":{"label":"Another example of redesign ruining a good app"}, "content":{"label":"The new redesign is a disaster. Removed the ability to select and delete multiple episodes. Can no longer control sorting. Can't choose to download a playlist to listen offline. Downloads streamed podcasts multiple times wasting bandwidth and causing delays. A bunch of fancy design things with swiping that add no functionality. \n\nWas a premium subscriber. Now looking for replacement that works.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id138946044"}, "name":{"label":"Nattatta"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-27T07:24:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"11540996694"}, "title":{"label":"No more streaming?"}, "content":{"label":"As a previous Stitcher user, I was just getting used to this app. The latest update is making me question things yet again… you have to bring back the streaming option. Please!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id16624022"}, "name":{"label":"T3ster12"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-26T14:03:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"11538431565"}, "title":{"label":"Great app ruined by recent update"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve used Overcast for years without issue, now the app won’t even download episodes (it just stays at 0% on WiFi or LTE, I have to then ‘delete’ the nonexistent file, force restart the app, which sometimes works but often doesn’t). It’s a shame this wasn’t beta tested before being rolled out. Since it’s unusable in this state, I’m off to find a new player. Hope you can sort this out!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id637289095"}, "name":{"label":"Barcelona Travel Guy Review"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-26T13:56:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"11538415012"}, "title":{"label":"Simply Amazing App!"}, "content":{"label":"The title says it all.  The functionality and features are awesome, it is super easy to use, and the new updates are great.  I have literally tried every podcasting app is this is the one I always circle back to!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
