{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id41078404"}, "name":{"label":"Mickers"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-19T11:56:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.7.1"}, "id":{"label":"11511840199"}, "title":{"label":"Latest update not great"}, "content":{"label":"It was never a particularly beautiful app (though I love the app icon), but it worked well enough and has good audio features (trim silence and speed control). Unfortunately, the rebuilt version has made it unusable for me—the sleep timer, which I used daily, is now hidden away behind multiple taps and is very difficult to enable. Shortcuts integration has also been removed, so the shortcut I used to set a 15-min sleep timer no longer functions. Furthermore, the design is just all over the place and my playlists have been de-emphasized in the interface. I’m now looking for alternatives.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id29528224"}, "name":{"label":"silentbrad"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-19T10:32:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.7.1"}, "id":{"label":"11511612856"}, "title":{"label":"I loved this app"}, "content":{"label":"It was great, and absolutely a 5-star before. I absolutely understand that you spent the last 18 months overhauling the code - loads of work and it’s just you working on it. But with no streaming, I’m having loads of trouble. One podcast I listen (and relisten) to constantly is taking upwards of half an hour to download, despite my fairly good wifi (second fastest speed my ISP offers). Please bring back streaming, or add a feature to automatically download the next one or two episodes in a playlist - I don’t have the space on my phone to download 600 episodes of the one podcast, plus the others that I listen to on top of that. \n\nAlso, unless I’ve missed it, the option to rate/review podcasts would be cool.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
