{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id468027003"}, "name":{"label":"Evan.J.P."}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-09T17:32:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.6"}, "id":{"label":"11474928815"}, "title":{"label":"Solid"}, "content":{"label":"Overcast is a great option for those of us who are trying to edge away from algorithms online. It’s worth noting that this is an app you need to fiddle with to make work for you. Using the playlist functionality is absolutely key.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id281370492"}, "name":{"label":"Ballsuponya"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-06T17:57:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.6"}, "id":{"label":"11464341508"}, "title":{"label":"Best Podcast App and No Close Second"}, "content":{"label":"It’s just the best app. It’s worth the price, and you won’t find an app that makes more intuitive sense.\n\nThere’s nothing you can’t do. I’d say that I’d like a better layout to find your current subscribed apps with no current episodes. This is so small and I bet it gets fixed. If it doesn’t, it’s because 7 people agree and 1 million don’t, other than that, every thing I didn’t like has been resolved — and it was still the best app on the market without those changes.\n\nI couldn’t tell you the free alternative. I’m sorry, if you can’t justify the cost for your own personal reasons that’s fair, I’m just at a total loss to find anything that approximates it. And I’ve tried quite a few!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
